    <briefdescription>
<para>JSON-serialising admin/ops API for the GPU module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides three read-only and one simulation endpoint:</para>
<para>GET /admin/gpu/stats — Global VRAM stats, circuit state, fallback count. GET /admin/gpu/tenants — Per-tenant VRAM usage and quota breakdown. GET /admin/gpu/devices — Per-device load from the load balancer. POST /admin/gpu/simulate — Dry-run allocation check using <ref refid="structthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_config" kindref="compound">GPUConfig</ref> rules.</para>
<para>All methods return a UTF-8 JSON string; no HTTP transport is assumed so the class can be used from any HTTP framework or CLI tool.</para>
<para>Thread safety: methods are const and delegate to thread-safe sub-systems. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
